    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Who we are</strong></span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DigiCert is a global leader in intelligent trust. We protect the digital world by ensuring the security, privacy, and authenticity of every interaction. Our AI-powered DigiCert ONE platform unifies PKI, DNS, and certificate lifecycle management, to secure infrastructure, software, devices, messages, AI content and agents. Learn why more than 100,000 organizations, including 90% of the Fortune 500, choose DigiCert to stop today’s threats and prepare for a quantum-safe future at&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.digicert.com/\">www.digicert.com</a></span></p></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Job summary</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As an Associate Solutions Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in combining technical expertise with strong sales acumen to identify, qualify, and close new business opportunities across a defined portfolio of customer and partner accounts.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Your day-to-day responsibilities will involve close collaboration with customers, partners, and Account Managers to deliver business value, conduct demos and POC/Vs, and contribute to the success of bids and tenders. You will provide end-to-end technical and business value guidance before and during the sales cycle ensuring customer requirements are met with tailored, innovative solutions.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Acting as a trusted technical advisor, you will be a key point of contact for clients, offering strategic insight and hands-on support. You'll also work closely with cross-functional teams to align solutions with customer needs and organizational goals.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Expected Travel is 20-25%</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>What you will do</strong></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Customer Engagement and Technical Discovery</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Conduct technical discovery calls to understand customer requirements, pain points, and existing infrastructure.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Lead or participate in product demonstrations, showing how solutions meet client-specific needs.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Translate complex customer requirements into actionable technical solutions or configurations.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assist with scoping customer environments to recommend best-fit products or services.&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Solution Design and Architecture</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Create technical documentation, architecture diagrams, and integration guides for customer engagements.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Deliver engaging technical presentations that deliver business value to external stakeholders and customers.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Design customized technical solutions based on client needs, often involving product configuration, integration planning, and API usage.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Collaborate with product and engineering teams to validate feasibility or escalate edge-case needs.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Produce architecture diagrams, technical proposals, or proof-of-concept (PoC) plans.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Support the preparation and delivery of RFP/RFI responses, technical questionnaires, and bid documentation.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Cross Functional Collaborations</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Partner with Account Executives and Customer Success Managers to align technical value with customer goals.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Liaise with Product Managers to share customer feedback and advocate for feature enhancements or roadmap items.</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>What you will have</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Educational Background:</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Degree in Computer Information Systems, Computer Science, Cybersecurity, or a related technical field.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Experience as an SE or technical salesperson, or equivalent and applicable experience as a product manager, engineer, tech support agent or administrator of enterprise-grade or IT/IS software</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General knowledge or background in IT (ideally server administration, server OS configuration, TCP/IP networking hardware, protocols, LAN and WAN technologies &amp; configurations, and network design) and/or IS (ideally PKI, firewall management, IDS &amp; IPS, vulnerability management, and network scanners), in engineering, administration or support roles</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Familiarity with cryptographic principles, digital certificates, and PKI concepts.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Knowledge of cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Oracle Cloud) and container technologies like Kubernetes.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Experience or familiarity with ServiceNow, GitHub, and REST API integrations.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Hands-on exposure to scripting and automation using Bash, PowerShell, Python, or similar languages.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Experience with DevOps and infrastructure automation tools (e.g., Terraform, Ansible, Puppet, Chef)&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Soft Skills</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Self-motivated with ability to self-direct in strategic alignment with sales counterparts</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Technical, organized and analytical, with ability to eliminate sales obstacles through creative/innovative thinking</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passion for continuous learning and applying innovative solutions to complex challenges.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Situational awareness and business acumen skills to support self-held critical values of professionalism, humility, and customer-focus</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Basic project management skills to accomplish role requirements</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Strong communications, interpersonal and presentation skills, in both written and verbal formats</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fluency in English</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Nice to have</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bonus Skills (Nice to Have, but Not Required)</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Cybersecurity certifications (CISSP, GSEC, CCSP, etc.).</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Hands-on experience with certificate management and cryptographic tools.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Familiarity with code signing, load balancers, and secure key storage.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Understanding of SSO, SAML, OpenID authentication methods.</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a proactive security mindset.</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Benefits</strong></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Competitive compensation, including uncapped commission (role-dependent)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Achievers Club awards and performance-based incentives</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Pension and retirement benefits (location dependent)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Life insurance and income protection coverage</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Comprehensive health and wellness support, including medical coverage (where applicable), gym reimbursement, and mental wellbeing resources</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Employee Assistance Program with 24/7 confidential support for employees and their families</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Generous paid time off, including holidays and&nbsp;additional&nbsp;leave options</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Family-friendly leave policies, including maternity, paternity, and other supportive leave programs</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Education&nbsp;assistance&nbsp;and professional development opportunities</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Access to LinkedIn Learning and continuous learning resources</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Employee referral bonus program and&nbsp;additional&nbsp;company&nbsp;perks&nbsp;and discounts</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW64308306 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW64308306 BCX0\">Internal rewards and recognition platform (</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW64308306 BCX0\">Motivosity</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW64308306 BCX0\">) to celebrate and acknowledge project wins, milestone achievements, and the outstanding contributions of our colleagues</span></span></span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Business travel insurance and global employee support programs</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">To protect candidate information and maintain a secure hiring process, all applications must be submitted through our careers portal. Resumes or CVs sent directly via email will not be reviewed or considered.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">#LI-MG1</span></p><div class=\"content-pay-transparency\"><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"description\"><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW779494 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW779494 BCX0\">Compensation Transparency:&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW779494 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559731&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The total on-target earnings (OTE) for this role, including base salary and variable incentive compensation&nbsp;(at 100% target performance), are outlined below.</span> <span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Each candidate’s compensation offer will be&nbsp;determined&nbsp;based on factors including experience, skills, qualifications, performance expectations, business needs, and location. Actual earnings may vary based on individual performance. This role may also be eligible for&nbsp;additional&nbsp;compensation and benefits, which will be discussed during the hiring process.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are committed to fair and transparent pay practices and&nbsp;comply with&nbsp;all applicable pay transparency requirements. If you would like more information about compensation or benefits, we are happy to provide&nbsp;additional&nbsp;details during the hiring process.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">For more information&nbsp;regarding&nbsp;our comprehensive benefits,&nbsp;see the benefits section.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class=\"title\">OTE</div><div class=\"pay-range\"><span>£65,000</span><span class=\"divider\">&mdash;</span><span>£70,000 GBP</span></div></div><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"title\">Base Salary</div><div class=\"pay-range\"><span>£45,500</span><span class=\"divider\">&mdash;</span><span>£49,000 GBP</span></div></div><div class=\"pay-input\"><div class=\"title\">Incentive Compensation</div><div class=\"pay-range\"><span>£19,500</span><span class=\"divider\">&mdash;</span><span>£21,000 GBP</span></div></div></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
