    schema:description "<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><em>The ideal candidate will be based in London and should be willing and able to travel across Europe for additional client engagements as needed.</em></span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About Us:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Pacvue&nbsp;is the leading Commerce Media OS, powering over $12B in advertising spend across 100+ global retail media networks including Amazon, Walmart, Target, Kroger, Instacart, Criteo, and&nbsp;CitrusAd. Powered by industry-leading AI and real-time data,&nbsp;Pacvue&nbsp;enables over 70,000 brands and agencies to maximize advertising performance, drive incrementality, and expand reach across the commerce universe from a single mission control. As of 2025,&nbsp;Pacvue&nbsp;powers 12% of total retail media ad spend worldwide excluding China. Combined with Helium 10’s SMB solutions,&nbsp;Pacvue&nbsp;delivers the industry’s most comprehensive platform for businesses of all sizes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">At&nbsp;Pacvue&nbsp;and Helium 10, great careers&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;just happen —&nbsp;they’re&nbsp;built. Here,&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;rise as an industry leader, push the boundaries of innovation, own your journey, and thrive as part of an inclusive global community&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;redefining the future of commerce.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About the&nbsp;Role:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">We are&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">seeking</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">&nbsp;an experienced and strategic Director of EMEA Marketing to lead the marketing function across Europe.&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">This role owns the EMEA marketing function end-to-end, partnering with global marketing leadership on shared standards while holding full accountability for regional strategy and results, reporting</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">into our GM of EMEA</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW75588371 BCX8\">The Director will lead the EMEA marketing organization through a team of managers, each owning a discipline (demand gen, partner marketing, content), and will reconcile competing priorities across sales, product, corporate leadership, and global functional heads as the senior voice for EMEA.</span></span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Responsibilities:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Set and own EMEA marketing strategy, contributing directly to how the global function evaluates and refines its overall approach across regions</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Shape and set EMEA marketing strategy and&nbsp;methodology, contributing directly to how the global function evaluates and refines its overall approach across regions</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lead and manage a high-performing marketing team; set performance expectations and foster talent development&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Oversee integrated marketing campaigns across digital, content, and traditional channels with close collaboration on regional execution of global campaigns&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Shape regional marketing&nbsp;methodology&nbsp;and priorities, influencing how global strategy itself is defined for EMEA and other regions</span><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Partner with the global product marketing team to localize messaging, positioning, and product strategies for key EMEA markets&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Partner with the global demand generation team to localize campaigns and strategies for key EMEA markets; ensure regional market fit and sales alignment</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Work with the global events team to ensure EMEA representation and participation; tailor global event strategies for regional relevance&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Drive lead generation and pipeline development in collaboration with regional sales teams&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Measure campaign performance and ROI through data analytics; provide regular reporting to leadership on regional performance health</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Skills &amp; Qualifications:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">12+ years of marketing experience, including senior leadership responsibility across regional or global functions</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Proven experience leading marketing teams and managing regional/global marketing functions&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Strong&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in B2B marketing (experience in SaaS, technology, or professional services preferred)&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Demonstrated success developing and executing integrated marketing strategies</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Strong analytical skills with ability to interpret data and drive insights</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Proficiency&nbsp;with marketing automation platforms, CRM systems, and analytics tools</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Experience working in matrix organizations and collaborating across functions&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ability to work effectively in a fast-paced, results-driven environment</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ability to challenge the “status-quo” and not be afraid to test new, bold ideas</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">#LI-remote</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><em data-stringify-type=\"italic\">Pacvue is committed to employing a diverse workforce. Qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, or disability.</em></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-pacvue ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-director-marketing-emea-259293" ;
    schema:jobLocationType "ON_SITE" ;
    schema:title "Director Marketing, EMEA" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/pacvue/director-marketing-emea-259293> .

