    schema:title "SAP ABAP Entwickler – Fokus Cloud & API Integration (REST, OData, BTP) – Vollzeit (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/24-log-gmbh/remote-sap-abap-entwickler-fokus-cloud-api-integration-rest-odata-btp-vollzeit-passau-250921> .

