    schema:description "<p><span class=\"s17\">This is an exciting<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s17\">10-month</span><span class=\"s17\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>fixed term role that will</span><span class=\"s17\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s17\">will</span><span class=\"s17\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>develop and execute international campaign strategies for the Columbia &amp; Epic label rosters. You will be responsible for effectively and creatively managing<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s17\">a number of </span><span class=\"s17\">international campaigns across an eclectic roster of superstar and developing artists and tracks, working closely with both the UK labels and international markets on development and execution.&nbsp;</span></p> <div class=\"iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job\"> <div class=\"iCIMS_Expandable_Container\"> <div class=\"iCIMS_Expandable_Text\"> <h2><strong>What you'll do:</strong></h2> <ul> <li>Bring a modern and proactive approach to building international marketing campaigns for our artists</li> <li> <div class=\"s28\"><span class=\"s27\">Work closely with the International digital lead and collaborate cross company with the UK labels and central teams (Commercial Partnerships, Strategy &amp; Insight) to develop and align strategies for maximum impact</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s28\"><span class=\"s27\">Collaborate closely with the<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s27\">International</span><span class=\"s27\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>markets to implement campaign rollout, localizing activations as needed and ensuring good communication throughout regarding strategy, asset delivery, campaign updates etc</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s28\"><span class=\"s27\">Monitor data/dashboards to inform plans and strategy</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s28\"><span class=\"s27\">Regular, comprehensive updates for artist management and UK labels as campaign progresses</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s28\"><span class=\"s27\">Become a core part of the artist’s Sony team,&nbsp;contributing to the success of their music&nbsp;globally</span></div> </li> </ul> <h2 class=\"iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job\"><strong>Who you are:</strong></h2> <ul> <li>Previous experience in an International Marketing or Digital role, managing major artist campaigns</li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Open to candidates from a Domestic label background</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Globally minded with a deep knowledge of the international music landscape</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Creative, innovative, and proactive, driven to seek out opportunities and take on exploratory projects</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Digitally savvy, with extensive knowledge of social media, and familiar with using data to inform marketing strategy</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Ability to work across a varied roster managing several campaigns simultaneously</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">Detail oriented, an excellent communicator and enthusiastic collaborator who works well as part of a team</span></div> </li> <li> <div class=\"s41\"><span class=\"s27\">You must be passionate about music and the music industry</span><span class=\"s42\">&nbsp;</span></div> </li> </ul> <h2 class=\"iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job\"><strong>What we give you:</strong></h2> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:true}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The space to accelerate progress, positively disrupt and create what happens next</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We give you the platform to champion positive change, with the opportunity to contribute to our social impact, diversity, equity and inclusion initiatives</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"•\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We provide an excellent range of benefits like private medical cover, a generous pension scheme, life assurance, income protection, plus loads of music industry perks. There’s also time off over winter break</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h2 class=\"iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Equal Opportunities</strong></h2> <p>As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.<br><br>We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.<br><br><strong>Privacy Policy</strong><br><br>Please click&nbsp;<a href=\"http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>&nbsp;to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.</p> <p><strong>Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age.</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
